        - weight: 60
          module:
          - rid: 5841915870972215302
          statUsed: 0
          output: 'The faithful do their part! Though they possess little, our flock
            recognizes the crisis we are facing. May the Beholder bless them! [Gained
            30 Wealth] '
        - weight: 20
          module:
          - rid: 5841915870972215303
          statUsed: 0
          output: 'Miserly wretches! Our "faithful" offer nothing more than paltry
            alms. At this rate, we will never recover. [Gained 10 Wealth]'
        - weight: 10
          module:
          - rid: 5841915870972215304
          - rid: 5841915870972215305
          statUsed: 0
          output: 'A rival cult seized upon our plea for aid to aggrandize themselves,
            even donating to our cause! We collected very little, and worse still,
            they lured away our followers! Curse them!

            [Gained 10 Wealth,
            Lost 30 Flock]

